[{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0020","text":"……制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0030","text":"啊，你醒了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0040","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0050","text":"……抱歉，Producer"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0060","text":"没事，你多休息会儿吧\n还得花不少时间呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0070","text":"今天的工作\n累了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0080","text":"嗯\n这个倒没什么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0090","text":"刚才的话，说到一半吧\n……因为我睡着了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0100","text":"诶？\n啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0110","text":"不……真不是什么大不了的事\n忘了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0120","text":"嗯……不过\n既然你都开口了，就告诉我吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0130","text":"是、是吗？\n那好吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0140","text":"……回家的时候，想开门\n结果不小心拿手机“滴”了一下——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0150","text":"就是这种事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0160","text":"……就这点感想？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0170","text":"呜……\n是、是啊，确实"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0180","text":"……总觉得，有点不好意思"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0190","text":"不会啊\n能醒过来真好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s40_07070000_03_0200","text":"因为听到了\n制作人说的“不是什么大不了的事”"}]
